WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.835
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.336
We hope you're doing well.
And now if you don't mind,

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:05.705
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:09.108
President Biden celebrated
his 80th birthday yesterday

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:12.779
with a brunch hosted by
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden.

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.748
Brunch, or as 80-year-olds
call it, dinner.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:17.617
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:19.018
President Biden today pardoned

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.154
the national Thanksgiving
turkey,

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:24.624
but I don't know if this is one
we want back on the streets.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:28.494
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.830
That's right.
President Biden today pardoned

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.766
the national Thanksgiving
turkeys, Chocolate and Chip.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:34.967
And then this is weird.

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.937
He sent the green bean casserole
to Gitmo.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:42.809
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:47.012
RNC chairwoman Ronna McDaniel
reportedly told top Republican

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:49.215
donors last week that the party
needs to avoid

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:51.918
factionalism and unify
like a family.

00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.955
Ah, yes, spoken like a person
who's never been in a family.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.623
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.623 --> 00:01:00.593
After missing eight games, the
Brooklyn Nets yesterday allowed

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:03.062
Kyrie Irving to return
to the team after

00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:06.232
apologizing for posting a link
to an anti-Semitic documentary.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:09.102
It's a miracle.
His suspension was only supposed

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:12.138
to last for one game,
but it lasted eight.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:17.209
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:20.113
President Biden over the weekend
called the U.S. soccer men's

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.280
national team and gave them

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.848
a pep talk
ahead of the World Cup.

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:24.050
I'm not sure if it worked,

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.185
but they were definitely late
for the game.

00:01:26.185 --> 00:01:28.054
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.090
NASA's Orion capsule today
passed the moon and flew around

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.893
its backside, and scientists
were shocked by

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.595
what they found
on the other side.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:39.565
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:42.335
We're taking submissions
from second graders this week.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:46.706
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:50.075
A book was recently returned to
a library in Minnesota

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:52.178
after being overdue
for nearly 50 years.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.914
The book was titled
"How to Stop Procrastinating."

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.081
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.081 --> 00:01:59.285
The book is so old,
that joke was in it.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.321
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:04.924
And finally, Amtrak next month
will expand service

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:06.391
between New York City
and Albany.

00:02:06.391 --> 00:02:07.760
"Hell yeah!" said Albany.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.696
And "we're good!"
said New York City.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:10.763
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.732
That was a monologue, everybody.

